# CampusExchange Frontend Environment Configuration

# Backend API Base URL
# In local development, leave this empty to use the built-in Vite dev proxy (/api -> http://localhost:5000)
# When deploying the frontend independently to production (e.g., Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pages),
# set this to your hosted backend API URL:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend-api.onrender.com/api/v1
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
